    {
      "id": "claim_21bdaa2ff4384fb2afe4e9da9b56c02c",
      "statement": "The inbound HTTP pipeline installs shared Vert.x Web stages in the order BodyHandler, ResponseTimeHandler, TimeoutHandler, RequestLoggingHandler, ClientAuthorizationHandler, then the instrument business route, with a route-wide ExceptionHandler failure handler and a last ResponseHandler, so requests are body-buffered, logged, authorized, routed, and finally responded to through shared handlers.",
